flowchart TB
  User --> Profile[User / business profile]
  Profile --> Submit[Submit required KYC evidence]
  Submit --> Upload[Validated restricted document storage]
  Upload --> Review[Compliance review]
  Review --> Approved[Verified state]
  Review --> Correction[Correction / additional evidence]
  Correction --> Submit
  Review --> Rejected[Reasoned rejected state]
  Privacy[Minimum necessary access + sanitized audit] --- Review
